  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.36 “Employee” means a person working full-time in the state classified service whose assignment to work has been approved by the appointing authority and the director.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; ss by #10801, eff 5-17-15; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.32), eff 12-1-25",
